<!-- ========== PROGRAMS ========== -->
<section class="programs" id="programs">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Programs &amp; Services</h2>
    <p class="programs-subtitle">Comprehensive humanitarian support — from the first hours to the years that follow.</p>
    <div class="accordion" id="programAccordion">
      <div class="accordion-item active">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="true">
          Disaster Relief
          <span class="accordion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body" style="max-height: 200px;">
          <div class="accordion-body-inner">Rapid deployment of emergency shelter, food, water, and medical supplies to communities affected by natural disasters and conflict. Our response teams are on the ground within 24 hours of a crisis, coordinating with local partners to ensure aid reaches the most vulnerable populations quickly and efficiently.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          Blood Donation
          <span class="accordion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="accordion-body-inner">Operating one of the largest blood collection networks, we supply approximately 40% of the nation's blood and blood products to hospitals and medical facilities. Every two seconds, someone in the country needs blood — our network of donors and collection sites makes life-saving transfusions possible.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          Emergency Preparedness
          <span class="accordion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="accordion-body-inner">Training individuals, families, and organizations to prepare for and respond to emergencies through workshops, certification courses, and community drills. Our preparedness programs empower communities with the skills and knowledge needed to protect themselves and their neighbors when disaster strikes.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          International Humanitarian Aid
          <span class="accordion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="accordion-body-inner">Partnering with a global network of humanitarian organizations to deliver relief and recovery programs in conflict zones and disaster-affected regions worldwide. Our international work spans emergency response, long-term development, and capacity building with local organizations.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion-item">
        <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          Community Health
          <span class="accordion-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="accordion-body">
          <div class="accordion-body-inner">Providing health and safety education, disease prevention programs, and support services to underserved communities, including mental health resources for disaster survivors. We believe that strong community health systems are the foundation of disaster resilience.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== GET INVOLVED ========== -->
